"PWM，否则会导致摄像头无法工作。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:350
msgid ""
"**TIM4 is shared with** :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` — instantiating a servo"
" reconfigures the whole timer for 50 Hz operation, so don't mix "
":ref:`machine.PWM <machine.PWM>` on P7/P8/P9 with :ref:`pyb.Servo "
"<pyb.Servo>` in the same script."
msgstr ""
"**TIM4 与** :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` **共用** —— 实例化一个舵机会将整个定时器重新配置为 50 Hz "
"工作，因此请勿在同一脚本中将 P7/P8/P9 上的 :ref:`machine.PWM <machine.PWM>` 与 "
":ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` 混用。"

