"``-1`` 即可使用虚拟（软件）定时器::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:438
msgid ""
"Period values are in milliseconds. Call :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` to "
"stop and release the slot."
msgstr "周期值以毫秒为单位。调用 :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` 可停止并释放该槽位。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:442
