msgstr ":ref:`machine.RTC <machine.RTC>` 可在复位后保持挂钟时间::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:453
msgid "Watchdog"
msgstr "看门狗"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:455
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` resets the board if the application hangs. "
"Once started it can't be stopped or reconfigured — feed it periodically "
"inside your main loop::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` 会在应用程序卡死时复位开发板。一旦启动便无法停止或重新配置 —— "
"请在主循环内定期喂狗::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:467
msgid "Boot and runtime info"
msgstr "启动与运行时信息"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:470
msgid "USB bootloader window"
msgstr "USB 引导加载程序窗口"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:472
msgid ""
"On every power‑up the camera runs a short bootloader (a few seconds) that "
"lets OpenMV IDE update the firmware without the user having to enter DFU "
"mode. After the window expires the bootloader hands off to ``boot.py`` and "
"then ``main.py``."
msgstr ""
"每次上电时，摄像头都会运行一个短暂的引导加载程序（几秒钟），让 OpenMV IDE 无需用户手动进入 DFU "
"模式即可更新固件。该窗口期结束后，引导加载程序会将控制权移交给 ``boot.py``\\ ，随后再移交给 ``main.py``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:477
msgid ""
"A running script can re‑enter the bootloader on demand by calling "
":func:`machine.bootloader`::"
msgstr "正在运行的脚本可通过调用 :func:`machine.bootloader` 按需重新进入引导加载程序::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:485
msgid "Filesystem and boot order"
msgstr "文件系统与启动顺序"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:487
msgid "The M7 firmware mounts up to three filesystems on boot:"
msgstr "M7 固件在启动时最多会挂载三个文件系统："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:489
msgid ""
"**Internal flash** — always mounted at ``/flash``. Holds ``main.py`` and "
"``README.txt`` by default; created on the very first boot."
msgstr ""
"**片内闪存** —— 始终挂载于 ``/flash``\\ 。默认存放 ``main.py`` 和 ``README.txt``\\ "
"；在首次启动时创建。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:491
msgid "**microSD card** — if a card is inserted it is mounted at ``/sdcard``."
msgstr "**microSD 卡** —— 若插入了卡，则会挂载于 ``/sdcard``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:493
msgid ""
"**ROMFS** — read‑only, memory‑mapped filesystem at ``/rom`` used to ship "
"large data assets (e.g. AI models) that benefit from zero‑copy access. "
"Mounted automatically by MicroPython at startup, before any user Python "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"**ROMFS** —— 位于 ``/rom`` 的只读、内存映射文件系统，用于发布受益于零拷贝访问的大型数据资源（例如 AI 模型）。由 "
"MicroPython 在启动时、任何用户 Python 代码运行之前自动挂载。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:498
msgid ""
"After mounting, the working directory is set to ``/sdcard`` when the card is"
" present, otherwise ``/flash``. The interpreter then runs scripts from that "
"directory:"
msgstr "挂载完成后，当存在卡时工作目录会设为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则设为 ``/flash``\\ 。解释器随后从该目录运行脚本："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:502
msgid ""
"``boot.py`` is executed on **every** soft reset (cold boot, ``Ctrl‑D`` from "
"the REPL, or whenever the running script returns)."
msgstr "``boot.py`` 在\\ **每次**\\ 软复位时执行（冷启动、从 REPL 按 ``Ctrl‑D``\\ ，或正在运行的脚本返回时）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:504
msgid ""
"``main.py`` is executed **only on cold boot**, immediately after "
"``boot.py``. Subsequent soft resets re‑run ``boot.py`` but drop straight to "
"the REPL — to re‑run ``main.py`` you have to fully reset the board."
msgstr ""
"``main.py`` **仅在冷启动时**\\ 执行，紧随 ``boot.py`` 之后。后续的软复位会重新运行 ``boot.py`` 但会直接进入"
" REPL —— 要重新运行 ``main.py``\\ ，你必须彻底复位开发板。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:509
msgid ""
"Dropping a ``boot.py`` or ``main.py`` onto the SD card overrides the copy in"
" flash without touching it — both files are looked up in the boot directory "
"(``/sdcard`` when the card is mounted, otherwise ``/flash``)."
msgstr ""
"将 ``boot.py`` 或 ``main.py`` 放到 SD 卡上会覆盖闪存中的副本而不会改动它 —— "
"这两个文件都会在启动目录中查找（挂载了卡时为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则为 ``/flash``\\ ）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:514
msgid ""
"The default ``main.py`` shipped on a freshly flashed board just blinks the "
"user RGB LED's **blue** channel as a heartbeat (two short pulses, short "
"gap), so you can tell the firmware booted cleanly without any host attached."
msgstr ""
"刚刷写好的开发板上随附的默认 ``main.py`` 只是将用户 RGB LED 的\\ **蓝色**\\ "
"通道作为心跳进行闪烁（两次短脉冲，短暂间隔），这样你无需连接任何主机即可判断固件是否干净启动。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:519
msgid ""
"``sys.path`` is extended to include all three filesystems and their ``lib/``"
" subdirectories, so importable modules can live in ``/flash/lib``, "
"``/sdcard/lib``, or ``/rom/lib``."
msgstr ""
"``sys.path`` 已扩展为包含全部三个文件系统及其各自的 ``lib/`` 子目录，因此可导入的模块可以放在 ``/flash/lib``\\ "
"、\\ ``/sdcard/lib`` 或 ``/rom/lib`` 中。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:523
msgid ""
"To force the system to ignore an inserted SD card (for example to run the "
"flash ``main.py`` even with a card present), create an empty file named "
"``SKIPSD`` at the root of ``/flash``."
msgstr ""
"若要强制系统忽略已插入的 SD 卡（例如即使插着卡也要运行闪存中的 ``main.py``\\ ），请在 ``/flash`` 根目录下创建一个名为 "
"``SKIPSD`` 的空文件。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:527
msgid ""
"When connected over USB, the boot filesystem (``/sdcard`` if a card is "
"present, otherwise ``/flash``) also enumerates as a USB mass‑storage drive "
"on the host, letting you edit ``boot.py``, ``main.py``, and any other files "
"directly. **Eject the drive before resetting the camera** so the host "
"flushes its cached writes."
msgstr ""
"通过 USB 连接时，启动文件系统（若存在卡则为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则为 ``/flash``\\ ）也会在主机上枚举为一个 USB "
"大容量存储驱动器，让你可以直接编辑 ``boot.py``\\ 、\\ ``main.py`` 以及任何其他文件。\\ "
"**复位摄像头之前请先弹出该驱动器**\\ ，以便主机刷新其缓存的写入。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:535
msgid ""
"Because the OS treats the drive as a passive block device, files created or "
"modified by code running on the OpenMV Cam will not show up until the host "
"re‑mounts the drive. If both the OS and the OpenMV Cam write the same "
"filesystem at the same time, the OS will win and overwrite changes made by "
"the camera. Use the SD card for any data the script writes back, and remount"
" before reading those files from the host."
msgstr ""
"由于操作系统将该驱动器视为被动的块设备，由 OpenMV Cam 上运行的代码创建或修改的文件在主机重新挂载驱动器之前不会显示出来。如果操作系统与 "
"OpenMV Cam 同时写入同一文件系统，操作系统会胜出并覆盖摄像头所做的更改。请将脚本写回的任何数据存到 SD "
"卡，并在从主机读取这些文件之前重新挂载。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:545
msgid ""
"The user RGB LED's **red** channel may briefly light up while the host is "
"reading from or writing to the USB mass‑storage drive — this is a "
"firmware‑driven activity indicator, not a fault."
msgstr ""
"当主机正在从 USB 大容量存储驱动器读取或向其写入时，用户 RGB LED 的\\ **红色**\\ 通道可能会短暂点亮 —— "
"这是固件驱动的活动指示，而非故障。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:550
msgid "Storage sizes"
msgstr "存储容量"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:552
msgid "The M7 ships with:"
msgstr "M7 出厂时配备："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:554
msgid "``/flash`` — **96 KB** FAT filesystem, read/write."
msgstr "``/flash`` —— **96 KB** FAT 文件系统，可读写。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:555
msgid "``/rom`` — **256 KB** read-only memory-mapped ROMFS."
msgstr "``/rom`` —— **256 KB** 只读、内存映射的 ROMFS。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:556
msgid ""
"``/sdcard`` — full size of whatever microSD card is inserted (when present),"
" read/write."
msgstr "``/sdcard`` —— 所插入的 microSD 卡的全部容量（存在时），可读写。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:560
msgid "Hard‑fault indicator"
msgstr "硬故障指示"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:562
msgid ""
"If the user RGB LED is rapidly cycling through all colours — fast enough "
"that it tends to look like a **twinkling white LED** rather than distinct "
"hues — the firmware has hit an unrecoverable hard fault. Reflash the "
"firmware to recover; if reflashing doesn't help, the board may be physically"
" damaged."
msgstr ""
"如果用户 RGB LED 正在快速循环切换所有颜色 —— 快到看起来更像是\\ **闪烁的白色 LED** 而非各种分明的色调 —— "
"则说明固件遇到了无法恢复的硬故障。请重新刷写固件以恢复；如果重刷无济于事，开发板可能已发生物理损坏。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:569
msgid "Software libraries"
msgstr "软件库"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:571
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`library index </library/index>` for the full list of modules —"
" including which ones are unique to the M7 build."
msgstr "完整的模块列表（包括哪些模块为 M7 构建版本所独有）请参阅 :doc:`库索引 </library/index>`\\ 。"
